sequenceDiagram
    participant Queue as Message Queue<br/>(Redis / GCP Pub/Sub)
    participant Transport as Transport Layer<br/>(pipeline.Flow)
    participant Merge as Merge Policy<br/>(random-robin)
    participant Gate as Flow-Control Gate<br/>(Prometheus-backed)
    participant Worker as Worker Pool<br/>(goroutines)
    participant ModelSrv as Model Server<br/>(Inference Gateway)
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>(gRPC)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443 HTTPS
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    participant Scraper as Prometheus Scraper

    Note over Queue,Transport: Request Ingestion Flow

    Queue->>Transport: Deliver inference request<br/>(Redis :6379/TCP or GCP :443/gRPC TLS)
    Transport->>Merge: Forward request via channel
    Merge->>Worker: Distribute to named pool<br/>(random-robin policy)

    Note over Gate,Prom: Flow-Control Check

    Worker->>Gate: Check dispatch gate
    Gate->>Prom: Query metric<br/>(e.g. GPU util, queue depth)<br/>HTTP :9090
    Prom-->>Gate: Metric value
    Gate-->>Worker: Allow / throttle

    Note over Worker,ModelSrv: Inference Dispatch

    Worker->>ModelSrv: POST inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (optional mTLS TLS 1.2+)
    Worker->>OTel: Export trace span<br/>(gRPC)
    ModelSrv-->>Worker: Inference result
    Worker->>Transport: Publish result to result channel
    Transport->>Queue: Write result message

    Note over Worker,Transport: Retry Path

    alt Inference failure / timeout
        Worker->>Transport: Publish to retry channel
        Transport->>Queue: Write retry message
    end

    Note over Kubelet,K8sAPI: Health & Metrics

    Kubelet->>Worker: GET /healthz :8081<br/>(unauthenticated)
    Worker-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Kubelet->>Worker: GET /readyz :8081<br/>(unauthenticated)
    Worker-->>Kubelet: 200 OK

    Scraper->>Worker: GET /metrics :9090<br/>(Bearer token)
    Worker->>K8sAPI: Validate bearer token<br/>HTTPS :6443
    K8sAPI-->>Worker: Auth result
    Worker-->>Scraper: Prometheus metrics
